        "text": "One thrown in a `setTimeout` callback",
        "correct": true,
        "why": "Not caught."
      },
      {
        "text": "One thrown in a `useEffect`",
        "correct": false,
        "why": "Caught: effects are part of the commit."
      },
      {
        "text": "One thrown in a child's body while it renders",
        "correct": false,
        "why": "Caught: that is the main case."
      }
    ]
